('b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000103', 3, 'post_test', 'The base commonly found in milk of magnesia.', 'Magnesium hydroxide [Mg(OH)₂]', 'The correct term is: Magnesium hydroxide [Mg(OH)₂].', true),
